    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public authorities law, in relation to directing the New\nYork state energy research and development authority to prepare a report\nregarding the replacement of decommissioned or dormant electric generating\nsites with renewable energy development and energy storage opportunities",
    "basePrintNo": "S3439",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3439-2023",
